<title>TURKEY: TURKEY 1996 TRADE DEFICIT $19.4 BLN, UP 37.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>TURKEY 1996 TRADE DEFICIT $19.4 BLN, UP 37.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's trade deficit in 1996 rose 37.7 percent to $19.4 billion from $14.1 billion a year earlier, the chairman of the State Statistics Office said at a news conference.</p>
</text>
